{"seq":3,"slug":"scene-understanding","title":"场景理解与语义建图","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/embodied-intelligence/foundations-and-perception/scene-understanding","wordCount":1404,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"场景理解与语义建图\">场景理解与语义建图</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>当机器人进入一间陌生的客厅，它需要的不仅是一堆点云坐标——它需要知道&quot;沙发在左边，茶几上有一杯水，水杯可以被抓取，茶几不能被穿越&quot;。将原始几何感知提升为这种结构化、可推理的语义表示，就是场景理解的核心目标。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三维物体检测与分割\">三维物体检测与分割</h3><p>从点云或 RGB-D 数据中定位并识别物体是场景理解的第一步：</p>\n<p><strong>3D 物体检测</strong>将目标物体用三维边界框（Bounding Box）标注：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>l</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>w</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B = (x, y, z, l, w, h, \\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x, y, z)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 为中心坐标，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>w</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(l, w, h)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 为尺寸，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 为航向角。代表性方法包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>VoteNet</strong>：从点云中学习投票方向，聚合投票生成候选框</li>\n<li><strong>3DETR</strong>：将 DETR 的 Transformer 架构扩展到三维空间</li>\n<li><strong>点云分割</strong>：PointNet++ 的层次化特征聚合 + 实例分割头</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>开放词汇检测</strong>允许使用自然语言描述来定位任意物体，突破了固定类别的限制。典型方法：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CLIP + 3D 特征对齐（如 OpenScene）</li>\n<li>2D 基础模型检测结果反投影到 3D（Grounding DINO → 3D Lifting）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"语义-slam\">语义 SLAM</h3><p>传统 SLAM 只估计几何结构（稀疏/稠密地图），语义 SLAM 在此基础上为地图元素附加语义标签：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">M</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{M} = \\{(p_i, l_i, c_i)\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为空间位置，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为语义标签，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为置信度。</p>\n<p>关键技术组件：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>实时语义分割</strong>：在 SLAM 前端中嵌入轻量语义网络（如 FastSAM）</li>\n<li><strong>语义数据关联</strong>：利用语义一致性辅助回环检测与重定位</li>\n<li><strong>增量式语义融合</strong>：贝叶斯更新每个体素/surfel 的类别概率</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;RGB-D 输入帧&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;视觉里程计&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;语义分割网络&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;位姿图优化&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;语义标签&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; F[&quot;几何地图&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;语义三维地图&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; H[&quot;场景图生成&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"RGB-D 输入帧\"] --&gt; B[\"视觉里程计\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"语义分割网络\"]\n    B --&gt; D[\"位姿图优化\"]\n    C --&gt; E[\"语义标签\"]\n    D --&gt; F[\"几何地图\"]\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[\"语义三维地图\"]\n    G --&gt; H[\"场景图生成\"]</pre><h3 id=\"三维场景图\">三维场景图</h3><p>三维场景图（3D Scene Graph）是比语义地图更高层的结构化表示，将场景编码为<strong>节点</strong>（物体、区域、建筑）和<strong>边</strong>（空间关系、功能关系）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">G</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">V</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{G} = (\\mathcal{V}, \\mathcal{E})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7805em;vertical-align:-0.0972em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0593em;\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0822em;\">V</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0894em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>节点属性包括：类别、位姿、尺寸、外观特征、功能标注（affordance）。\n边的类型包括：<code>on_top_of</code>、<code>inside</code>、<code>next_to</code>、<code>part_of</code> 等。</p>\n<p><strong>Hydra</strong> 系统实现了实时增量式场景图构建，包含 5 个层次：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>物体层</td>\n<td>独立可移动物体</td>\n<td>杯子、椅子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>场所层</td>\n<td>可达区域</td>\n<td>厨房中心区域</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>房间层</td>\n<td>封闭空间</td>\n<td>厨房、卧室</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>建筑层</td>\n<td>建筑结构</td>\n<td>楼层、翼楼</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>度量层</td>\n<td>底层几何表示</td>\n<td>3D 网格、TSDF</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"空间推理与-affordance\">空间推理与 Affordance</h3><p>场景理解的最终目标是支撑机器人的行为决策。两个关键能力：</p>\n<p><strong>空间推理</strong>：回答&quot;杯子在桌子上方吗？&quot;&quot;从这里能看到门吗？&quot;等空间关系查询。形式化为场景图上的图查询或基于嵌入的空间关系预测。</p>\n<p><strong>Affordance 检测</strong>：判断物体的可操作属性——&quot;这个把手可以被抓取&quot;、&quot;这个按钮可以被按压&quot;。通常通过视觉特征学习 affordance heatmap：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>action</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext>visual features at </mtext><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(p) = P(\\text{action} | \\text{visual features at } p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">action</span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">visual features at </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"神经隐式场景表示\">神经隐式场景表示</h3><p>NeRF 及其后续工作提供了另一种场景表示范式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Θ</mi></msub><mo>:</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_\\Theta: (x, y, z, \\theta, \\phi) \\rightarrow (c, \\sigma)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>将空间坐标映射为颜色 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 和密度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>。对具身智能的价值：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>新视角合成</strong>：规划相机移动路径前预测观察效果</li>\n<li><strong>语义 NeRF</strong>：每个采样点附加语义标签，实现任意视角的语义渲染</li>\n<li><strong>3D Gaussian Splatting</strong>：2024-2025年兴起的显式辐射场表示，实时渲染性能达 200+ FPS</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>ConceptGraphs (2024)</strong>：利用 LLM 将开放词汇检测结果组织为语义场景图，支持自然语言查询（&quot;找到最近的可以坐的东西&quot;）</li>\n<li><strong>SayPlan / SQA3D</strong>：将场景图与大语言模型结合，实现基于场景理解的任务规划</li>\n<li><strong>OK-Robot (2024)</strong>：零样本开放世界物体抓取，依赖预训练视觉模型和语义记忆</li>\n<li><strong>实时动态场景图</strong>：面向非静态环境（有人活动的家庭），实现物体状态变化的在线追踪</li>\n<li><strong>多模态场景基础模型</strong>：统一 2D、3D、语言的大规模预训练模型（如 PQ3D）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>对比 TSDF（Truncated Signed Distance Field）和 3D Gaussian Splatting 两种三维表示方法的优劣。它们各自在什么具身任务场景中更适用？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>设计实验：使用 Habitat 仿真器加载一个室内场景，运行一个简单的语义 SLAM 系统（前端用 ORB-SLAM3 + 语义分割），构建带语义标签的三维地图。评估语义标注的准确率与 SLAM 定位精度之间的关系。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>思考：场景图中的空间关系（如 <code>on_top_of</code>）在真实世界中往往是连续的而非离散的。一个杯子&quot;几乎&quot;要从桌子上掉下来——如何在场景图中表示这种不确定性？这对机器人决策有什么影响？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>对比两种场景记忆方案：（a）保存完整三维地图 + 离线查询，（b）保存语义场景图 + 在线增量更新。从存储效率、查询速度、信息保真度三个维度分析各自的适用场景。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>场景理解将原始几何数据转化为结构化、可推理、可查询的语义表示。从三维物体检测到语义 SLAM，再到层次化场景图与 affordance 检测，本节系统梳理了具身智能体理解环境的技术栈。这一&quot;世界模型&quot;为后续的任务规划、导航与操作提供了决策所需的环境知识。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"场景理解与语义建图","id":"场景理解与语义建图"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"三维物体检测与分割","id":"三维物体检测与分割"},{"level":3,"text":"语义 SLAM","id":"语义-slam"},{"level":3,"text":"三维场景图","id":"三维场景图"},{"level":3,"text":"空间推理与 Affordance","id":"空间推理与-affordance"},{"level":3,"text":"神经隐式场景表示","id":"神经隐式场景表示"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多模态感知融合","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/embodied-intelligence/foundations-and-perception/multimodal-perception"},"next":{"title":"强化学习与机器人控制","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/embodied-intelligence/decision-and-control/reinforcement-learning-robotics"}}